### Seed Bella demo
POST http://localhost:8317/api/dev/seed

### Forgot password (always 200 + neutral message; never reveals if the email exists)
POST http://localhost:8317/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com" }

### Reset password (token comes from the email; dev logs it as "reset link")
POST http://localhost:8317/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "PASTE_TOKEN_FROM_LINK", "password": "newpassword123" }

### List pets
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets

### Pet overview
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/overview

### Check-ins
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/check-ins

### Latest check-in
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/check-ins/latest

### Create or update check-in
POST http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/check-ins
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checkInDate": "2026-06-29",
  "itchingScore": 6,
  "stoolState": "SOFT",
  "appetiteLevel": "NORMAL",
  "waterLevel": "LOWER",
  "energyLevel": "RESTLESS",
  "vomiting": false,
  "earRedness": true,
  "freeTextNote": "More paw licking after dinner."
}

### Food logs
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/food-logs

### Current food
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/food-logs/current

### Create food log
POST http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/food-logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateStarted": "2026-06-29",
  "foodKind": "TREAT",
  "brand": "Happy Tail",
  "productName": "Chicken Training Bites",
  "primaryProtein": "CHICKEN",
  "secondaryProteins": ["EGG"],
  "grainFree": false,
  "newFood": true,
  "notes": "Small treat during training."
}

### Delete a check-in (Sprint 12)
DELETE http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/check-ins/{{checkInId}}

### Delete a food log (Sprint 12)
DELETE http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/food-logs/{{foodLogId}}

### Patterns
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/patterns

### Set owner status on a pattern (Sprint 8)
POST http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/patterns/{{patternId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SHARED_WITH_VET"
}

### Pattern timeline by stable id (Sprint 5)
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/patterns/{{patternId}}/timeline

### Pattern timeline by type (fallback)
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/patterns/timeline?type=POSSIBLE_FOOD_TRIGGER

### Vet-ready summary (Sprint 6)
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/vet-summary

### Vet-ready summary for a custom range
GET http://localhost:8317/api/pets/{{petId}}/vet-summary?days=45

### AI-assisted daily note parse (Sprint 7)
POST http://localhost:8317/api/ai/parse-daily-note
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "petId": "{{petId}}",
  "note": "Bella scratched a lot today, stool was softer, she ate normally, and yesterday we gave her a new chicken treat."
}
